01:42.930 --> 01:45.180
It did say two bags of potting soil.

01:45.180 --> 01:47.460
We're going to update that to three.

01:47.460 --> 01:49.440
And then once both of those are done,

01:49.440 --> 01:52.680
we'll make a commit that includes both of those files.

01:52.680 --> 01:54.630
And then you should use this message.

01:54.630 --> 01:55.740
And then the very last thing

01:55.740 --> 01:58.560
is to use some unnamed git command

01:58.560 --> 02:01.380
that we've covered to display all of those commits.

02:01.380 --> 02:03.690
And we should see three commits.

02:03.690 --> 02:07.440
So that's a set of instructions, hopefully straightforward,

02:07.440 --> 02:10.440
