02:10.440 --> 02:11.880
You can always reference them,

02:11.880 --> 02:13.140
it's more about making sure you have

02:13.140 --> 02:16.920
the conceptual flow down of how you make a commit.

02:16.920 --> 02:19.740
Okay, so I highly recommend you try it

02:19.740 --> 02:21.600
